(ShellLocalizer → Localization.Get → Strings/{lang}/Resources.resw) via
localizer.GetString("systemStatus.<key>", "<web English default verbatim>"), the same
i18n contract every sibling System page (DBHealthPage, StatusApiDocsPage, IncidentTimelinePage)
satisfies (ADR-014). PassthroughLocalizer asserts each default headlessly. Web glyphs
preserved verbatim (em-dash "—", middle-dot "·"); i18next {{var}} templates interpolated by
SystemStatusProjection.Interpolate.

